=== SURVEY ===
Surveyed existing widget patterns (NotificationStatsWidget, MQTTStatusWidget, UptimeMonitorWidget).
Checked APICallLogStats type at @/types/admin — fields: totalCalls, errorRate, avgDurationMs, last24h, errorCount.
Note: type uses camelCase (post-camelCaseKeys transform), no by_method/by_service/calls_per_hour fields available.
Reviewed WidgetShell freshness props, WidgetStatGrid shared component, WidgetRankedList shared component.
Reviewed registry.ts — system category section identified for insertion.

=== REASONING ===
- 4 stat cards for standard (2×2): Total Calls (24h), Avg Response (ms), Error Rate (%), Errors count.
- Error rate card goes red (text-red-400) when >5% via valueColor on StatGridItem.
- Wide (2×4): same 4 stats with cols=4 layout. No bar chart possible — API type lacks hourly breakdown data.
- Compact (cols<=1): single big number showing total calls with error rate warning.
- All strings via useTranslation('dashboard').
- Null-safe: data?.last24h ?? 0, etc.
- Uses WidgetStatGrid from ./shared for stat cards layout.
- Freshness props passed through to WidgetShell.

